  "text": "AFK Blood Reavers \n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work.\n​\nIntroduction\n⬥ Blood Reaver binding contracts  are a good alternative to bossing for generating GP and a necessary evil for ironmen who wish to pursue many of the strategies outlined in PVME.\n​\n⬥ The below method assumes you have already prepared or collected your blank Binding Contracts from either:\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Making them yourself after the Dragon Bye quest\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Getting from Ancient Caskets (in stacks of 50)\n​\nPositioning\n\n⬥ Inside Nex's encampment, stand in the south-middle area\n⬥ You will be dragged around as you are aggro'd\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Occasionally a Blood Reaver may walk away - you may wish to click them manually (or wait for it to wander back into range)\n​\nUseful Items and Unlocks\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe majority of the below items and unlocks will increase your KPH, but are not mandatory:\n\nEssential items:\n⬥ Enchanted notepaper  for noting the contracts \nNon-essential items:\n⬥ Demon Slayer (perk) \n⬥ Demon slayer equipment  \n⬥ Damage-boosting auras like  \n⬥ Damage-boosting prayers  \n    • Require extra prayer restoration from  or \nPoison-boosting:\n⬥ Weapon Poison+++ \n⬥ Cinderbane gloves \n⬥ Kwuarm sticks \n⬥ Blood reaver  with \n⬥ Vampyrism aura \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\n Ranged AFK Method (500+ kph)\nPresets and Relics\n​\n⬥ Ranged preset \n​\n​\n\nAction Bars\n\n​\n Necromancy AFK Method (500+ kph)\nPresets and Relics\n​\n⬥ Necromancy preset (500+ pouches/hour) \n​\n​\n\nAction Bars\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥  Necromancy - 500 pouches/hour (no DPS prayer/familiar)\n⬥  Ranged - 600 pouches/hour (with DPS prayer + familiar)\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Blood Reavers ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work. ​ Introduction ⬥ Blood Reaver binding contracts are a good alternative to bossing for generating GP and a necessary evil for ironmen who wish to pursue many of the strategies outlined in PVME. ​ ⬥ The below method assumes you have already prepared or collected your blank Binding Contracts from either: ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Making them yourself after the Dragon Bye quest ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Getting from Ancient Caskets (in stacks of 50) ​ Positioning ⬥ Inside Nex's encampment, stand in the south-middle area ⬥ You will be dragged around as you are aggro'd ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Occasionally a Blood Reaver may walk away - you may wish to click them manually (or wait for it to wander back into range) ​ Useful Items and Unlocks The majority of the below items and unlocks will increase your KPH, but are not mandatory: Essential items: ⬥ Enchanted notepaper for noting the contracts Non-essential items: ⬥ Demon Slayer (perk) ⬥ Demon slayer equipment ⬥ Damage-boosting auras like ⬥ Damage-boosting prayers • Require extra prayer restoration from or Poison-boosting: ⬥ Weapon Poison+++ ⬥ Cinderbane gloves ⬥ Kwuarm sticks ⬥ Blood reaver with ⬥ Vampyrism aura ​ Ranged AFK Method (500+ kph) Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Ranged preset ​ ​ Action Bars ​ Necromancy AFK Method (500+ kph) Presets and Relics ​ ⬥ Necromancy preset (500+ pouches/hour) ​ ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Necromancy - 500 pouches/hour (no DPS prayer/familiar) ⬥ Ranged - 600 pouches/hour (with DPS prayer + familiar) ​",
